# Root-context allowlist; keep local credentials, data and generated output out.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!scripts/
!scripts/docker-npm.mjs
!Maps VN/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/tsconfig.base.json
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/packages/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/packages/contracts/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/packages/contracts/**
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/packages/housing-query/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/packages/housing-query/**
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/platform-api/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/platform-api/**
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/database/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/database/migrations/
!Maps VN/LifeFlow/database/migrations/**
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
**/tests
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.crt
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
